  "title": "Sausage and Egg Casserole",
  "description": "This sausage and egg casserole is the perfect combination of eggs, sausage, bread, and cheese. Everyone loves this tender and delicious recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Kathleen Donnelly Ernst"
  ],
